Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.10,0:01:08.10,Staff,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}翻校: 假修 後期: 真冬
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.10,0:01:12.10,Staff,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}紫音字幕組 http://www.pusacg.org
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.95,0:00:05.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.95,0:00:05.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那津
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.62,0:00:09.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看你看 筆頭菜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.62,0:00:09.87,Remark,NTP,0,0,0,,注: 問荊，又名杉菜、筆頭菜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:13.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我採了好多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.43,0:00:18.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那津
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.96,0:00:23.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那津天氣一熱就會熱昏頭呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.17,0:00:27.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請喝麥茶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.67,0:00:33.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那津 我唸故事書給你聽
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.02,0:00:37.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,森林的熊先生和松鼠先生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:46.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把包袱布裝得滿滿的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.04,0:00:49.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那津
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.16,0:00:52.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那津 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.58,0:00:56.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要去冬眠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.01,0:00:59.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那津
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.17,0:01:02.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那津
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.46,0:01:07.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為小町每年都哭成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.26,0:01:10.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就改掉了呢 冬眠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.54,0:01:14.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有過這種事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.46,0:01:20.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那津
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.19,0:01:22.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後啊 這時候的小町...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.99,0:01:23.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那津
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.96,0:01:28.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我果然還是想去都市的高中
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-OP-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.46,0:03:05.02,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(594,432)}險\N惡\N之\N路
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.60,0:03:08.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我果然還是想去都市的高中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.41,0:03:12.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我之前不就說過了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.04,0:03:15.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對小町來說 都市太危險了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.86,0:03:18.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要緊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.52,0:03:21.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼不要緊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.58,0:03:23.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之就是不要緊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.48,0:03:25.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就問妳什麼不要緊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.41,0:03:39.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.34,0:03:44.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然妳說最近能從CD改成用MD錄音了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.41,0:03:49.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但大部分的廠商都已經收掉MD的業務了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.48,0:03:57.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一臉開心地向我報告的妳真令我感到痛心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.22,0:03:59.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好了 小町
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.44,0:04:04.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妳的情報簡陋程度 在都市是致命的...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.47,0:04:06.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.72,0:04:11.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,實在是有夠囉嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.09,0:04:12.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妳這懶熊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.41,0:04:15.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.83,0:04:17.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前不是已經用猜謎解決了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.97,0:04:20.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼卑鄙的根本無效 無效
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.65,0:04:20.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.98,0:04:24.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再說了 在我的許可之前 應該還需要其他人的許可吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.29,0:04:27.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,良夫他怎麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.65,0:04:30.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會支持妳的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.82,0:04:33.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那津說可以的話 我也能開車載妳
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.86,0:04:34.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,緣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.22,0:04:36.11,Tip,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1062,713)}緣=町與良夫的奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.72,0:04:36.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去問那津
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.17,0:04:38.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.10,0:04:40.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛 好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.05,0:04:43.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 竟然讓決定權掌握在熊手裡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.50,0:04:45.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.44,0:04:46.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.32,0:04:47.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.70,0:04:50.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}笨蛋笨蛋笨蛋笨蛋…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.80,0:04:50.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,討厭 快住手啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.91,0:05:02.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你了 那津
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.21,0:05:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是怕生、不黯世事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.95,0:05:13.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有怕麻煩 我都會努力改掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.15,0:05:21.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.35,0:05:24.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那津
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.86,0:05:28.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是...現在的小町太令人擔心了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.37,0:05:31.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要學習各種東西才行喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.35,0:05:33.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.32,0:05:35.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社會性啊 一般常識啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.23,0:05:39.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地圖的看法啊 時刻表的看法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.88,0:05:43.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,電話的用法啊 電視的開啟方法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.95,0:05:47.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那津 最喜歡你了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.42,0:05:51.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好癢啊 小町
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:06:00.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我現在想給小町一道課題
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.51,0:06:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.99,0:06:06.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無論是什麼試煉我都會克服給你看的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.36,0:06:07.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,儘管來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.07,0:06:45.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寫好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.90,0:06:58.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你唸唸看 那津
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.93,0:07:01.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去{\fn华康少女字体\fs50}UNIQLO{\fn萝莉体 第二版\fs50}買{\fn华康少女字体\fs50}HEATTECH{\fn萝莉体 第二版\fs50}回來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.93,0:07:01.42,Remark,NTP,0,0,0,,HEATTECH: UNIQLO獨賣的發熱衣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.08,0:07:05.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你字真醜呢 那津
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.34,0:07:08.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別對熊要求太多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.30,0:07:10.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,時間限制是兩天
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.11,0:07:12.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兩天
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.46,0:07:14.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天開始 六日兩天
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.27,0:07:18.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能再這樣待著了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.22,0:07:20.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去準備才行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.75,0:07:27.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然還是用{\fn华康少女字体\fs50}Word{\fn萝莉体 第二版\fs50}打一打再列印出來比較好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.41,0:07:30.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那樣也就沒辦法練字了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.53,0:07:38.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該選擇要穿去{\fn华康少女字体\fs50}UNIQLO{\fn萝莉体 第二版\fs50}的衣服才行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.78,0:07:43.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道{\fn华康少女字体\fs50}UNIQLO{\fn萝莉体 第二版\fs50}在隔壁鎮的國道旁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.53,0:07:46.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然很常坐車經過 但沒進去過
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.59,0:07:49.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,騎自行車去那裡大概一小時
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.97,0:07:51.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 40分鐘就夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.55,0:07:55.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話雖如此 我家的門限是5點
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.55,0:07:56.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能太過悠閒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.87,0:07:59.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且山上4點就會變暗了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.02,0:08:01.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天一大早就出門吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.37,0:08:03.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,考慮到上述因素
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.84,0:08:07.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想選擇便於運動 又有點時髦的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.07,0:08:15.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 畢竟我當上國中生之後已經兩年沒買衣服了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.69,0:08:18.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直都是穿制服和運動服過活的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.15,0:08:22.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回家也都馬上換上這一身
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.20,0:08:24.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後宅在家裡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.64,0:08:26.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,討厭 那津這個笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.43,0:08:29.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一開始的難易度就太高了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.68,0:08:32.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再說{\fn华康少女字体\fs50}HEATTECH{\fn萝莉体 第二版\fs50}是什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.13,0:08:35.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘲笑我不太會外來語嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.92,0:08:39.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn华康少女字体\fs50}HEAT...TECH...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.18,0:08:44.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn华康少女字体\fs50}HEATTECH{\fn萝莉体 第二版\fs50}?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.31,0:08:46.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.50,0:08:48.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為這個從單字上來看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.83,0:08:50.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是暖氣設備
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.54,0:08:54.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我記得{\fn华康少女字体\fs50}UNIQLO{\fn萝莉体 第二版\fs50}是服裝店才對
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.14,0:08:57.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道還有賣暖氣設備嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.94,0:09:01.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有賣衣服 還有賣暖氣設備
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.92,0:09:02.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.55,0:09:05.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn华康少女字体\fs50}UNIQLO{\fn萝莉体 第二版\fs50}是五金賣場?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.30,0:09:09.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五金賣場的話就不用太過在意時尚了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.89,0:09:11.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿制服就夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.19,0:09:19.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是{\fn华康少女字体\fs50}HEATTECH{\fn萝莉体 第二版\fs50}...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.74,0:09:23.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這暖氣設備的大小能裝進自行車籃嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.33,0:09:26.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是這種的話應該很重 要奮力騎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.99,0:09:29.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且是會用到火的機械
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.62,0:09:37.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放進自行車籃 騎在碎石路時...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.96,0:09:41.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那津 {\fn华康少女字体\fs50}HEATTECH{\fn萝莉体 第二版\fs50}...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.18,0:09:43.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會爆炸...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.29,0:09:48.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我沒聽清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.05,0:09:49.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再說一次
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.39,0:09:52.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了 果然還是不問了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.81,0:10:02.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好 我好像又差點說了什麼白痴發言
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.37,0:10:03.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好危險
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.13,0:10:07.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是小型的電子式暖爐之類的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.51,0:10:11.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別用橫式文字耍帥 直接這樣說不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.01,0:10:14.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼嘛 不是很簡單嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.49,0:10:16.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是輕鬆的跑腿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.17,0:10:23.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.25,0:10:27.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(隔天)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.80,0:10:28.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雲量中
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.16,0:10:30.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,澄澈的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.29,0:10:33.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕佳的出門好日子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.77,0:10:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不用擔心中暑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.24,0:10:37.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.47,0:10:39.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不可能永遠都是好天氣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.10,0:10:42.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我出發了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.80,0:11:03.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.91,0:11:06.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 小町
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.54,0:11:10.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小町 不能過來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.55,0:11:13.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天這裡禁止通行
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.35,0:11:14.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,橋被沖走了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.45,0:11:27.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為是老舊的木橋呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.78,0:11:29.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腐朽之後掉下去了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.11,0:11:36.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘛 會走這裡的也只有小町和向緣奶奶租田的我們吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.95,0:11:39.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧 小町
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.66,0:11:43.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們明天之前會修好它的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.98,0:11:48.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還剩一天
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.31,0:12:05.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新架好的圓木橋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.75,0:12:09.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,與世俗隔絕生活至今的少女 小町
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.28,0:12:13.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這會成為通向夢想的橋梁嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.61,0:12:17.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一路順風
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.72,0:12:22.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又不是與世俗隔絕生活至今的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.70,0:12:31.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦 我的自行車不見了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.83,0:12:35.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悅子阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.64,0:12:37.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 小町
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.26,0:12:40.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒看到我的自行車
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.80,0:12:50.52,Tip,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1114,685)\fad(500,500)}雨宿悅子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.15,0:12:43.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦 小町的自行車不見了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.71,0:12:46.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 真是抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.34,0:12:50.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我家的人騎去田裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.89,0:12:54.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為今天是星期日 我還以為小町不會用到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.00,0:12:57.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,良夫的自行車倒是還在喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.62,0:12:59.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然沒人想騎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.16,0:13:10.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好重
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.94,0:13:16.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,椅子好軟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.42,0:13:23.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小町 要出門嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.10,0:13:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.94,0:13:44.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,速度會不會太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.66,0:13:47.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因為自行車太重了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.64,0:13:58.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慘了 我要死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:42.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那津...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.73,0:14:45.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我 那津
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.87,0:14:59.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,背好癢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.74,0:15:56.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.89,0:16:07.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拚命掙扎吧 小町
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.52,0:16:10.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要筆直穿過這座山
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.70,0:16:12.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定會是捷徑的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.94,0:16:15.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是我的試煉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.21,0:16:17.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是通向我的最終目的地——
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.85,0:16:18.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夢想的捷徑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.68,0:16:31.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼 這不是小町嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.75,0:16:32.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妳在做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.92,0:16:34.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那種陡坡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.70,0:16:36.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,楤木芽的話早就採光了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.70,0:16:40.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我嗎? 如妳所見 在溪釣啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:43.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為松叔喝醉還出去釣魚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.11,0:16:45.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我受他太太所托來看看情況
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.01,0:16:48.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他已經完全醉醺醺了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.82,0:16:49.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣很危險對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.94,0:16:52.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他說不釣到就不回去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.46,0:16:54.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就代替他釣了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.64,0:16:56.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 結果完全釣不到
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.30,0:17:00.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 {\fn华康少女字体\fs50}UNIQLO ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.53,0:17:02.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我載妳去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:07.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 松叔 收了 回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.27,0:17:11.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 良夫你釣到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.32,0:17:13.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松叔 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.64,0:17:15.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,釣到巫女了 巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.46,0:17:18.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好耶 真是難能可貴 難能可貴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.49,0:17:23.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是啊 我今天是來釣魚的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.52,0:17:25.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 松叔你都醉成這樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.32,0:17:28.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很危險喔 你太太很擔心喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.16,0:17:31.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才沒有 她怎麼可能擔心我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.52,0:17:34.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那隻河東獅總是...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.27,0:17:44.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小町要喝嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.79,0:17:47.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叔叔這瓶濁酒很好喝喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.49,0:17:49.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她還未成年喔 松叔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.74,0:17:51.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有你這樣是違反菸酒管理法的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.75,0:17:54.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn华康少女字体\fs50}UNIQLO ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.01,0:17:56.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈 真笨啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.99,0:17:58.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是五金賣場啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.83,0:18:01.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn华康少女字体\fs50}HEATTECH{\fn萝莉体 第二版\fs50}也不是暖氣設備
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.20,0:18:03.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好笨啊 小町
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.11,0:18:11.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 叔叔來買雙輕便涼鞋吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.29,0:18:13.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.71,0:18:17.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也買點什麼吧 牛仔褲之類的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.68,0:18:23.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總共1件 990元
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.56,0:18:23.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}來拍張小町的成長記錄吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.04,0:18:28.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收您一千元 找您10元
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.30,0:18:28.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}什麼成長記錄啊 是買胸罩嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.19,0:18:32.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了呢 小町
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.06,0:18:34.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初體驗呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.39,0:18:36.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松叔 這是性騷擾
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.09,0:18:37.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該吃紅豆飯了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.05,0:18:40.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.08,0:18:42.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小町生氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.63,0:18:46.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 巫女大人原諒我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.69,0:18:51.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的濁酒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.63,0:18:52.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回歸田地了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.19,0:18:56.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連我也打...為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.76,0:19:14.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fn华康少女字体\fs50}HEATTECH{\fn萝莉体 第二版\fs50}買到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.15,0:19:16.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.06,0:19:20.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那為什麼這麼不高興
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.67,0:19:25.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.25,0:19:29.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一個人什麼都做不到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.94,0:19:31.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.28,0:19:38.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,良夫的自行車也弄壞了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.25,0:19:40.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妳騎了那輛自行車啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.36,0:19:44.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結果最後讓良夫載我去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.62,0:19:47.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還以為妳一開始就會坐良夫的車去的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.78,0:19:59.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.97,0:20:01.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.11,0:20:07.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼嘛 那麼一開始就這樣跟我說不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.90,0:20:10.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就不用弄得這樣全身是傷…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.82,0:20:11.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小町
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.34,0:20:17.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先別說去目的地了 差點在山裡遇難是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.60,0:20:20.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妳知道山裡非常危險吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.69,0:20:25.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自行車壞掉的時候為什麼沒有回來呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.85,0:20:29.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算穿過那座山 妳以為妳還要走多久
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.16,0:20:31.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,討厭 有什麼關係
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.10,0:20:33.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經買到目標了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.07,0:20:35.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,合格 合格了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.25,0:20:40.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就合格
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.24,0:20:47.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯沒錯 只要結局完美就萬事OK了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.42,0:20:51.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的有反省嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.69,0:20:54.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後呢 買回來的東西我還沒看到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.33,0:20:56.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姑且讓我看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.80,0:21:14.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別這樣啊 別把{\fn华康少女字体\fs50}HEATTECH{\fn萝莉体 第二版\fs50}穿在巫女服裡面啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.63,0:21:29.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.54,0:21:33.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽 我的自行車呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-ED-
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.38,0:23:23.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小熊巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.34,0:23:26.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我肚子餓了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.93,0:23:30.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有味醂燒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.53,0:23:34.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,香草味冰淇淋呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.94,0:23:35.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.81,0:23:40.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}咬咬 吞 咬咬 吞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.90,0:23:44.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}咬咬咬咬 吞吞
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咬咬 吞 咬咬 吞
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咬咬咬咬...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.42,0:23:46.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小町還真喜歡香草味冰淇淋和味醂燒的組合呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.01,0:23:54.98,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\pos(592,505)}傳\N統\N守\N護\N者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熊巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-ED-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.95,0:21:59.49,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}さあさあ お逃げなさい
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.65,0:22:02.97,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}巫女さん 巫女さん お逃げなさい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.00,0:22:05.40,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}どうせ ついてくんでしょ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.48,0:22:08.60,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}くまさん くまさん お見通し
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.62,0:22:11.36,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}やっぱ バレちゃいました
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.64,0:22:14.25,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}だって私たちって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.52,0:22:17.33,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}ずっと 一緒にいるし
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.52,0:22:19.98,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}ラッセ！ラッセラッセラー
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.06,0:22:23.27,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}電波ないし 届かないし
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.31,0:22:25.75,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}Wi-Fi あるけどね
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.81,0:22:29.10,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}コンビニが コンビニじゃないし
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.16,0:22:31.61,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}だって田舎だもん
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.67,0:22:37.56,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}夕暮れで 即闇 獣道
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.61,0:22:40.76,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}いず ぬっ さん すう でーじぇーへーうぃーごー
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.79,0:22:43.21,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}OK！ 村人 チェキラ！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.26,0:22:46.19,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}巫女さん 巫女さん 熊出村の巫女さん
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.22,0:22:49.06,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}めんこいべ めんこいべ そっただことねぇべって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.11,0:22:51.98,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}にいちゃんも ねえちゃんも なめこばけ けけけ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.04,0:22:53.48,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}んだ んだ んだ んだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.51,0:22:54.92,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}KUMAMIKO DANCINGだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.96,0:22:57.81,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}くまみこだし DANCING
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.86,0:23:00.69,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}踊らにゃ 村 村 村民
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.74,0:23:03.58,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}あしたも この村
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.64,0:23:07.84,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}なんだかんだ ずっとHappy days
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.97,0:23:10.77,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}やっぱHappy days
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.88,0:23:15.24,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}めっちゃHappy days
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.32,0:23:18.02,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}エービーバディバディ みんなHappy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.14,0:23:19.49,ED-JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}はい 就寝
