Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.95,0:21:59.49,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}跑吧跑吧 快點逃跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.65,0:22:02.97,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}巫女小姐 巫女小姐 快點逃跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.00,0:22:05.40,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}反正你會跟上來的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.48,0:22:08.60,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}熊先生 熊先生 我都看穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.62,0:22:11.36,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}果然被發現了？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.64,0:22:14.25,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}畢竟我們
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.52,0:22:17.33,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}一直都在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.52,0:22:19.98,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}la se！la se la se la─
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.06,0:22:23.27,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}沒有信號 傳不到這
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.31,0:22:25.75,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}Wi-Fi 雖然是有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.81,0:22:29.10,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}便利商店 都不是便利商店了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.16,0:22:31.61,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}因為是鄉下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.67,0:22:37.56,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}太陽落山 夜幕降臨 山中小徑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.61,0:22:40.76,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}1 2 3 4 DJ here we go
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.79,0:22:43.21,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}OK 村民 check it out！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.26,0:22:46.19,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}巫女小姐 巫女小姐 熊出村的巫女小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.22,0:22:49.06,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}好可愛 好可愛 還說沒有這回事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.11,0:22:51.98,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}哥哥也好 姐姐也好 都是滑菇妖怪 怪怪怪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.04,0:22:53.48,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}沒錯 沒錯 沒錯 沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.51,0:22:54.92,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}就是熊巫女之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.96,0:22:57.81,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}反正是熊巫女 DANCING
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.86,0:23:00.69,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}不跳的話 村 村 村民
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.74,0:23:03.58,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}明天也在這個村子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.64,0:23:07.84,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}無論如何 都是Happy days
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.97,0:23:10.77,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}果然還是Happy days
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.88,0:23:15.24,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}超級Happy days
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.32,0:23:18.02,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}everybody body 大家Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.14,0:23:19.49,ED-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}好 就寢
