Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.21,0:01:47.99,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}我今天也有點慌亂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.02,0:01:49.45,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}啊　睡過頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.66,0:01:51.25,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}梳妝打扮可不能偷工減料
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.30,0:01:53.00,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}不行不行，怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.16,0:01:54.73,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}抓住{\fn华康少女字体\fs50}cute　心跳Magic！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.89,0:01:56.40,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}這件連身裙，很適合我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.60,0:01:58.30,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}不快點不行，已經這時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:02:00.05,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}好，我出門了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.81,0:02:05.32,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}原諒我吧　我也總有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.53,0:02:08.19,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}會長大成人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.23,0:02:14.34,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}但你還要待在我身邊喔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.71,0:02:18.99,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}因為　因為　很可怕嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.19,0:02:22.55,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}微微一笑　很困擾嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.68,0:02:25.45,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}在你那大大的手臂之中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.55,0:02:29.64,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}我想一直撒嬌下去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.67,0:02:32.99,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}等等我　好好地　回應我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.07,0:02:35.63,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}別裝作沒聽到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.74,0:02:41.75,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}即使魔法消失
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.83,0:02:43.97,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}緊緊　緊緊擁抱我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.27,0:02:47.33,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}再多　再多多擁抱我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.74,0:02:50.90,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}摸摸　摸摸我的頭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.25,0:02:54.53,OP-TW,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur1}再多　再多多摸摸我的頭
